<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>Explanatory Note</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As disclosed in the report on Form 6-K dated June
4, 2026 filed by Zhengye Biotechnology Holding Limited (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the
Company received a notification letter on May 29, 2026 from Nasdaq indicating that the closing bid price of the Company&rsquo;s Class
A ordinary shares had been below $1.00 per share for 30 consecutive business days and that the Company did not meet the minimum bid price
requirement set forth in Nasdaq Listing Rule 5550(a)(2) (the &ldquo;Minimum Bid Price Rule&rdquo;). Pursuant to Nasdaq Listing Rule 5810(c)(3)(A),
the Company has a compliance period of one hundred eighty (180) calendar days, or until November 25, 2026 (the &ldquo;Compliance Period&rdquo;),
to regain compliance with the Minimum Bid Price Rule. If at any time during the Compliance Period, the closing bid price per share of
the Company&rsquo;s Class A ordinary shares is at least $1.00 for a minimum of ten (10) consecutive business days, Nasdaq will provide
the Company a written confirmation of compliance and the matter will be closed.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">From July 20, 2026 to August 4, 2026, the closing
bid price of the Company&rsquo;s Class A ordinary shares has been at $1.00 per share or greater. Accordingly, on August 5, 2026, the Company
received a letter (the &ldquo;Compliance Letter&rdquo;) from Nasdaq informing the Company that it has regained compliance with the Minimum
Bid Price Rule. The Company continues to be listed on The Nasdaq Capital Market under the ticker symbol &ldquo;ZYBT&rdquo;.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On August 6, 2026, the Company announced through
a press release that it has regained compliance with the Minimum Bid Price Rule. A copy of this press release is attached hereto as Exhibit
99.1, and is incorporated by reference herein.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

